## Sign-Up Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant Backend as Next.js API
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase/Postgres DB

    User->>Frontend: Enter display name, email, and password
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/auth/password/signup
    Backend->>Auth: Sign up with email, password, metadata, redirect URL
    Auth->>Auth: Hash and salt password
    Auth->>DB: Create auth user
    Auth-->>Backend: Return session or email-confirmation response
    alt Session returned
        Backend->>DB: Find or create profile for auth user id
        DB-->>Backend: Return profile
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return profile and serialized session
        Frontend->>Frontend: Save session in localStorage
        Frontend-->>User: Navigate to authenticated app view
    else Email confirmation required
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return confirmation-required response
        Frontend-->>User: Ask user to check email
    end
```

## Sign-In Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant Backend as Next.js API
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase/Postgres DB

    User->>Frontend: Enter email and password
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/auth/password/signin
    Backend->>Auth: Password grant request
    Auth->>Auth: Verify password against stored password hash
    alt Credentials valid
        Auth-->>Backend: Return Supabase session/access token
        Backend->>DB: Find or create profile for auth user id
        DB-->>Backend: Return profile
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return profile and serialized session
        Frontend->>Frontend: Save session in localStorage
        Frontend-->>User: Navigate to authenticated app view
    else Credentials invalid
        Auth-->>Backend: Return auth error
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return error response
        Frontend-->>User: Show sign-in error
    end
```

## Protected API Request Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant Backend as Next.js API
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase/Postgres DB

    User->>Frontend: Open protected data view
    Frontend->>Frontend: Read saved session from localStorage
    Frontend->>Backend: API request with Authorization: Bearer access_token
    Backend->>Backend: Parse bearer token
    Backend->>Auth: Validate access token with Supabase /user endpoint
    alt Token is valid
        Auth-->>Backend: Return authenticated user id
        Backend->>DB: Query or modify rows scoped to authenticated user id
        DB-->>Backend: Return authorized data
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return protected data
        Frontend-->>User: Render protected view
    else Token is missing or invalid
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return 401 Unauthorized
        Frontend-->>User: Show unavailable/error state or require sign-in
    end
```

## Expired Token Refresh Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant Backend as Next.js API
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth

    User->>Frontend: Open protected data view
    Frontend->>Frontend: Check saved session expiration
    alt Session is expiring soon
        Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/auth/session/refresh with refresh token
        Backend->>Auth: Refresh Supabase session
        Auth-->>Backend: Return new access token and refresh token
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return serialized session
        Frontend->>Frontend: Save refreshed session in localStorage
    end
    Frontend->>Backend: Retry protected request with Bearer access token
```
